  "content": {
   "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"16960\" class=\"elementor elementor-16960\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Rev. Dr. David S. Bell, President &amp; Executive Director</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-a5743d5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a5743d5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-cb319f8\" data-id=\"cb319f8\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c567eac elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c567eac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><i><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #3e3e3e;\">Every church has a culture.</span></i></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #3e3e3e;\">Church culture may be intentional or accidental, welcoming, or exclusive, generous or protective, hopeful or discouraged. It shapes the congregation&#8217;s collective life and witness. The ethos is more than stated beliefs or social principles. It is what people experience when they worship, serve, lead, give and grow together.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-3c680e0\" data-id=\"3c680e0\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35dfd03 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"35dfd03\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1714\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https://umfmichigan.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AdobeStock_2210739393-1.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-16963\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://umfmichigan.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AdobeStock_2210739393-1.jpeg 1714w, https://umfmichigan.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AdobeStock_2210739393-1-300x224.jpeg 300w, https://umfmichigan.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AdobeStock_2210739393-1-1024x765.jpeg 1024w, https://umfmichigan.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AdobeStock_2210739393-1-768x574.jpeg 768w, https://umfmichigan.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AdobeStock_2210739393-1-153",
