  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"16810\" class=\"elementor elementor-16810\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;\">Twenty-Fourth Sunday After Pentecost</span></h2>\n<p>God of Grace, your promise of a heavenly kingdom inspires us. Help us not to let our comfort or preferences guide our giving. Awaken us to your urgency, and let our generosity reflect our hope in Christ&#8217;s return. Receive these gifts and use them for your glory. We pray in Jesus&#8217; name. Amen.</p>\n<p><em>Matthew 25:1-13</em></p>\n<p><!-- /wp:heading --></p>\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} --></p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
